WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.780
You know more roots than you think.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.060
Some you haven’t used yet.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.030
Try putting them to work:

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:11.380
press means push, tain means hold, lev means lift.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:16.120
Find a word with one of them and use it in your own writing.
